{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/cb4cae69aa352e5e49838e8942df4680.avif?t=1755592509\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras_big/cb4cae69aa352e5e49838e8942df4680.avif?t=1755592509 width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep in mind, Skatehouse is <strong>a simplified version of a shop simulator,</strong> no customers walking around, just the fun of building your own little skate shop. Expect 4-5 hours of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/6e80eb1ff8cd5d93a786e6cfe445bb63.poster.avif?t=1755592509\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/6e80eb1ff8cd5d93a786e6cfe445bb63.webm?t=1755592509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/8799bb81b75ddc88568c6533f65642fc.poster.avif?t=1755592509\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/8799bb81b75ddc88568c6533f65642fc.webm?t=1755592509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/8799bb81b75ddc88568c6533f65642fc.mp4?t=1755592509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/85cf99e2e94129b00b2a8da67aa8e841.avif?t=1755592509\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras_big/85cf99e2e94129b00b2a8da67aa8e841.avif?t=1755592509 width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and customize your dream skate shop, choose what products to display, and manage individual skate parts. Upgrade your supply chain to produce more and keep your shelves stocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/69de6a9b28430e9281c328cdd5b955a4.poster.avif?t=1755592509\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/69de6a9b28430e9281c328cdd5b955a4.webm?t=1755592509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/69de6a9b28430e9281c328cdd5b955a4.mp4?t=1755592509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/580629a7ab659d24e4d88a4f28ee1e62.avif?t=1755592509\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras_big/580629a7ab659d24e4d88a4f28ee1e62.avif?t=1755592509 width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different parts and sell complete boards. Unlock new boards to meet skaters' demands and grow your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinl